{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261025/photo/bkn-20261025110202590-1025_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261025111025\"/><p>小笠原群島（圖）對出海域發生強震。</p><p>日本氣象廳探測得到，小笠原群島以西海域於當地時間周日（25日）上午11時10分（香港時間周日上午10時10分）發生黎克特制7級地震，沒有發出海嘯警報。</p><p>震央位於西之島對出西北海域，震源深度為470公里，屬深層地震。地震發生後，東京多區出現輕微震感。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:07.077494+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T03:02:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T08:20:35.723245+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:55.336922+00:00","content_hash":"225267f2220f576b118bc112176ea9cec92f4475b3dc5fe678dc7ab53bcf8ba8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}